1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:00,521
You pinch

2
00:00:00,521 --> 00:00:01,609
one nostril shut

3
00:00:01,609 --> 00:00:02,386
and the other one's

4
00:00:02,386 --> 00:00:03,280
blocked.

5
00:00:03,280 --> 00:00:04,226
Relax,

6
00:00:04,226 --> 00:00:04,947
your nostrils

7
00:00:04,947 --> 00:00:06,106
work in shifts,

8
00:00:06,106 --> 00:00:06,615
and that one's

9
00:00:06,615 --> 00:00:07,733
on its break.

10
00:00:07,820 --> 00:00:08,621
Spongy tissue

11
00:00:08,621 --> 00:00:09,128
inside

12
00:00:09,128 --> 00:00:09,954
fills with blood

13
00:00:09,954 --> 00:00:11,189
and swells one side

14
00:00:11,189 --> 00:00:12,360
nearly shut,

15
00:00:12,360 --> 00:00:12,875
while the other

16
00:00:12,875 --> 00:00:14,033
opens wide.

17
00:00:14,110 --> 00:00:15,564
Every few hours...

18
00:00:15,564 --> 00:00:16,667
they swap.

19
00:00:16,790 --> 00:00:17,729
You mostly notice

20
00:00:17,729 --> 00:00:18,468
when a cold

21
00:00:18,468 --> 00:00:19,967
swells both.

22
00:00:20,048 --> 00:00:20,942
Weirder:

23
00:00:20,942 --> 00:00:21,923
one fast,

24
00:00:21,923 --> 00:00:22,850
one slow,

25
00:00:22,850 --> 00:00:23,806
so each nostril

26
00:00:23,806 --> 00:00:24,779
smells the world

27
00:00:24,779 --> 00:00:25,401
a little

28
00:00:25,401 --> 00:00:26,620
differently.

29
00:00:26,810 --> 00:00:28,065
Go on...

30
00:00:28,090 --> 00:00:28,558
check who's

31
00:00:28,558 --> 00:00:30,041
on shift now.

